## Signatures:
```cpp
T* operator&(); // Address of
R& operator->*(S b); // Pointer-To-Member
R& operator,(const T& rhs); // Comma (yes, comma)
```

---
## Why?
Let me list from lease _please, don't_, and why.
| Operator | For what purpose? |
| -------- | ------------------ | --- |
| `->*` | Used for Pointer-To-Member access (Explained next) |
| `&` | Replaces default addres of. Don't. Just don't. |
